control: Each account spends under the lowered target its state row sets, and a target outside its range stops the run
removes: a reload keeps the lowered target an earlier reload read for each account it already knew, so a target the operator changes while the process runs never applies
packages: ./executioncontext/assembly
tests: TestALoweredTargetChangedBetweenReloadsAppliesFromTheNext
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

